Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anyone\Nregistered as Death Gun here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.79,0:00:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if he wants to stage another murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.43,0:00:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,B .O .B.'s perfect, he'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.01,0:01:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta find out the name of\NDeath Gun's Avatar and stop him.
