Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.25,0:03:32.25,Android,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\pos(610.5,279)\fscx42\fscy42}The Third\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NBullet of Bullets\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFinal Entry\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time he sees me it'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.61,0:03:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the final is like one big party
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be tougher than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For only a thousand creds,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.23,0:03:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hook you up with top-secret\Ninfo on all the top players!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.47,0:04:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes, all on Yamikaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.87,0:04:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what hookahs odds are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.47,0:04:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Dine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.65,0:04:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure he's got good gear and solid skills,\Nbut that dude's older than hell, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.99,0:04:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At best, he'd come in 15th today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.59,0:04:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to go with a\Nlong shot, go with Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.69,0:04:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you think I'm too old to get it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I was just saying, this\Nold dog's got some difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She hacks up people good\Nwith that Botox sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, a hot berserker with a blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon's weren't my type, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind getting\Na bullet for Xenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.03,0:04:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather get slashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And go play ALO with the fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Kirito! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:04:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you're all rude for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.15,0:05:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it! Good luck out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet my life savings on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.07,0:05:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit messing with them.
