Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.85,0:05:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so 30 players get dropped\Nrandomly across the same map,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then you go around\Nshooting whoever you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.99,0:05:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find and the winner's\Nthe last one standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.97,0:05:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to make me explain the\Nwhole damn thing to you after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you have email?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The admin sent the rules out, so it\Nshould be sitting in your inbox Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.21,0:05:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did scan through it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.55,0:05:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's like I wanted to make sure I\Nunderstood There was a lot of info to absorb
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absorb
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:05:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you pretty much got the gist of\Nit This thing's a battle royale
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between 30 players on the same\Nmap Star points are random,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.65,0:06:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and players are dropped about 1,000 meters\Naway from each other Whoa, a thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's got to be one insanely huge map.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you didn't\Nread the email, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a multi-stage arena,\N10 kilometers in diameter.
