Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes it challenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.27,0:06:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a game with gunfights, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, players get an item\Nto track other players.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called a satellite scan terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.43,0:06:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a satellite?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a spy drone or something? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.57,0:06:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It works just like in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It passes overhead every 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It scans the arena and then\Ntransmits the coordinates
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.19,0:06:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of all the players\Ndirectly to your terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.79,0:06:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:07:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So basically, you can only hide\Nin one spot for 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You catch on quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.93,0:07:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, doesn't all that moving\Naround put a sniper at a disadvantage?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifteen minutes is more than enough\Ntime for a sniper to do their job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fire, I kill my target, I move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we good here? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time we see each other,\Nyou can bet your ass...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please, hold up, hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what I really want to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.47,0:07:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you take a look\Nat this list real quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of all the B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,contestants, are there any first-timers\Nwhose names you don't recognize?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:07:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just look at it and tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's all you want\Nto know, I guess it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first-timers I don't know, besides\Na certain loser with a photon sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are three names.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great! Who? Point him out!
