Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is one of them Death Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.87,0:08:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to tell me what this is about,\Nor are you going to keep me in the dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting ready to blow a fuse over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.53,0:08:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, if you're trying to make\Nme mess up today by pissing me off,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.51,0:08:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.19,0:08:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it have anything to do with\Nwhy you were acting weird yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.59,0:08:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, after the prelims?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.61,0:09:12.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, this person I once played\Nagainst in another VR MMO came up to me.
