Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No. An enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.81,0:09:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember his name, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.59,0:09:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think we tried to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.93,0:09:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.91,0:09:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it like an argument\Nwith someone in your party?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something like that? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.13,0:09:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't kill someone over an argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.21,0:09:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Him and his group did horrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.97,0:09:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things like murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.21,0:09:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were too far gone, and the\Nonly way to stop them was by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.03,0:09:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't regret what I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:10:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but still, I've avoided\Ntaking responsibility for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.99,0:10:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forced myself to\Nforget it even happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.41,0:10:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.53,0:10:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no more running away, and this\Ntime, I have to face what I did head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to unload like that, just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could still\Npull the trigger, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you shoot a player\Nin here if you knew
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the real world that\Nplayer would die from it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what if you had to kill that player?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if you didn't, you or\Nsomeone you love would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had that power, could\Nyou still pull that trigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hirito, what's the name of\Nthe game you met that guy in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.71,0:10:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, never mind. That's personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.13,0:11:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should start heading over\Nto the waiting dome now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to check our gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.57,0:11:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And get ourselves psyched\Nup for this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.35,0:11:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.67,0:11:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get you've got your\Nreasons for being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.13,0:11:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got nothing to do\Nwith that promise you made.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta pay you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For what happened in yesterday's final?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You owe me a fight, so\Nyou better stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll survive and\Ngive you the fight you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're a battle junkie who loves\Nthe smell of gun oil and gun smoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.59,0:12:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then get ready!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.85,0:12:14.81,Dyne,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1578,384)\blur0.9\fscx73\fscy73\b1\frz312.1}Dyne
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.95,0:12:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Place your bets, because\Nwe're about to start!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.37,0:12:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.35,0:12:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you guys ready to find out who's\Nthe strongest player in Gun Gale Online,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the hardest game in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As usual, MMO Stream will be broadcasting\Nthe battle live and uncensored.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, help me out\Nwith the countdown, guys.
