Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright! Yeah! You go, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty-one survivors left in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Dine's on the run.
