Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Richie's got a heavy machine gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he'll sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.73,0:14:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He likes his prey coming to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.05,0:14:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go after Dyne and Pale Rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how he's doing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.87,0:15:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do I care?
