Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.16,0:15:12.20,Map,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\fscx99.13\fscy89.22\pos(581.94,273.09)\fs37.5\t(-184,42,\alpha&HFF&)}Lion King Richie
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, this guy's freaking persistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.67,0:15:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:16:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a mag full of rounds\Nwith your name on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You forgot to check your six again, Dine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.69,0:16:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a favor. Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late for any more favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.41,0:16:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of us dies right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want those guys\Nto know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to watch what\Nhappens on that bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.21,0:16:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't shoot, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.09,0:16:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what? That depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave after.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.03,0:16:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The minute you turn your\Nback, I'll blow you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.81,0:16:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, then fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for now, just stay quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.43,0:16:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.39,0:16:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But after they're done down\Nthere, it's you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.11,0:16:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stealth skills are pretty pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.13,0:17:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting him leave the area alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.19,0:17:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he makes a move, I'm taking the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.05,0:17:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, company?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.03,0:17:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.39,0:17:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.19,0:18:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He boosted his three-dimensional\Nmobility by carrying lighter gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His acrobatic skills are through the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.99,0:18:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.31,0:18:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.21,0:18:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.31,0:18:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.85,0:18:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only he had time to switch mags,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he could have shot from the\Nhip and killed him easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.73,0:18:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That pale guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.21,0:18:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's quick and powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's the one in the cloak.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.11,0:19:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.71,0:19:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we tried to kill\Neach other once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.11,0:19:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but it won't be\Neasy if he's who I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't dodge my bullet at this range.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.35,0:19:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a gunshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.43,0:19:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There wasn't one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.37,0:19:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.35,0:19:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could have been a laser\Nrifle with a muffled blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.27,0:19:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe a live ammo gun with a silencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.37,0:19:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, it wasn't a kill shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why isn't he moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.41,0:19:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think the shot came from the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was sniped from further away than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.41,0:19:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did a scan of the map not too long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.95,0:20:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one within\None kilometer of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that we're on the subject, you\Nmind telling me where you came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I was chasing after\Nthat pale rider guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.91,0:20:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no way. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.03,0:20:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the satellite was scanning the\Narea, I was swimming in that river.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.07,0:20:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess my location didn't register\Non the map because I was underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.15,0:20:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was all that gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.11,0:20:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, I took it all off before I dove in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stuck it in my item storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.01,0:20:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never knew we could use the\Nriver for cover from the satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.85,0:20:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon, check out his shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.45,0:20:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a weird light there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.99,0:20:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stun bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.81,0:21:03.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long has he been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.25,0:21:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a silent assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.35,0:21:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what his rifle's called?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.81,0:21:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.72,0:21:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a high-end sniper rifle\Nthat's got a badass silencer on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.57,0:21:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard rumors about there being one\Nin GGO, but I've never seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he can handle that gun,\Nhe must be some player.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.07,0:21:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he use his\Nhandgun to finish him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.53,0:21:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon, shoot! Huh? Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.77,0:21:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the guy in the cloak!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.19,0:22:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.21,0:22:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.55,0:22:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.46,0:22:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him fire that gun!
